WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:01.230
- I am a genius!

00:00:01.230 --> 00:00:02.063
- This is incredible.

00:00:02.063 --> 00:00:02.896
- Nobody understands.

00:00:02.896 --> 00:00:04.290
- You talked us out of that.

00:00:04.290 --> 00:00:05.123
- It's true!
(man laughing)

00:00:05.123 --> 00:00:06.840
You did talk her out of the right answer.

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:07.673
- Lost my game.

00:00:07.673 --> 00:00:08.730
- All right, one last time, come on.

00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:13.730
(suspenseful music)
(woman screaming)

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:18.290
- I'm gonna play an iconic horror scream,

00:00:18.290 --> 00:00:19.940
and you guys are gonna guess which one.

00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:20.820
- You're gonna give multiple choice,

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:21.683
and then we're going to decide?

00:00:21.683 --> 00:00:22.516
- [Interviewer] Yes, exactly.
- I see.

00:00:22.516 --> 00:00:24.203
- Cool. Let's go for it.
- Okay.

00:00:24.203 --> 00:00:25.036
(woman screaming)

00:00:25.036 --> 00:00:27.869
- [Anthony Michael Hall] "Scream."

00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:33.380
- I'm going with Shelley
Duvall, The Shining.

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:34.525
- You guys are right.

00:00:34.525 --> 00:00:35.358
(bell dings)
It is Shelley Duvall.

00:00:35.358 --> 00:00:37.486
- Nice going.
- Hey, yes!

00:00:37.486 --> 00:00:38.930
(woman screaming)

00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:41.229
- Okay. That was Psycho.
- Mommy.

00:00:41.229 --> 00:00:42.062
(bell dings)
- Was it mommy?

00:00:42.062 --> 00:00:42.934
- Mommy, yeah.

00:00:42.934 --> 00:00:43.767
(quizzer laughs)

00:00:43.767 --> 00:00:44.692
- Okay.

00:00:44.692 --> 00:00:48.251
(man screeching)

00:00:48.251 --> 00:00:49.476
- [Jason Blum] I'ma go Wicker Man.

00:00:49.476 --> 00:00:50.309
- [David Gordon Green]
You wanna go Wicker Man?

00:00:50.309 --> 00:00:51.142
Jamie, what do you think?
- I'll go with, yeah.

00:00:51.142 --> 00:00:52.520
- Because I hate horror movies,

00:00:52.520 --> 00:00:54.254
I'm gonna go with whatever you guys say.

00:00:54.254 --> 00:00:55.087
(host laughing)
- She hates them.

00:00:55.087 --> 00:00:55.920
- This is the greatest game ever.

00:00:55.920 --> 00:00:57.110
I love games.
- Okay.

00:00:57.110 --> 00:01:00.030
- James Caan.
- I was gonna say James Caan.

00:01:00.030 --> 00:01:00.947
- You are correct.
(bell dings)

00:01:00.947 --> 00:01:01.963
- And it's exact-
- I'm killing it over here!

00:01:01.963 --> 00:01:02.796
(man claps)

00:01:02.796 --> 00:01:03.870
- Well, unfortunately-
- What?

00:01:03.870 --> 00:01:04.703
- [Host] you guys were wrong,

00:01:04.703 --> 00:01:05.720
this was James Caan,
(buzzer blares)

00:01:05.720 --> 00:01:06.690
- And guess what?
- [Host] Misery.

00:01:06.690 --> 00:01:08.010
- Who was I gonna go with?

00:01:08.010 --> 00:01:09.330
- James Caan.
- James Caan.

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:10.163
- Trust your gut!

00:01:10.163 --> 00:01:11.401
- Shoot!
- I always do.

00:01:11.401 --> 00:01:13.148
(host laughing)
- Let's do the next one.

00:01:13.148 --> 00:01:13.981
- (laughing) Okay.

00:01:13.981 --> 00:01:15.455
(woman screaming)

00:01:15.455 --> 00:01:16.288
- Oh please.
(hand slapping)

00:01:16.288 --> 00:01:17.530
Give me a fucking break.
(others laughing)

00:01:17.530 --> 00:01:19.060
Are you kidding me?
(bell dings)

00:01:19.060 --> 00:01:20.243
Really?
- Nailed that one.

00:01:20.243 --> 00:01:21.076
- Is that Jamie?

00:01:21.076 --> 00:01:21.909
- Yes.
(contestants laughing)

00:01:21.909 --> 00:01:23.587
- Three for three. Nice, Kyle.

00:01:23.587 --> 00:01:26.083
- And I have to do just one more.

00:01:26.083 --> 00:01:29.833
(recording of man screaming)

00:01:31.048 --> 00:01:31.881
- [Jamie Lee Curtis] Middle.

00:01:31.881 --> 00:01:32.714
- I recognize that.

00:01:32.714 --> 00:01:33.547
- Bruce Campbell.
- I agree.

00:01:33.547 --> 00:01:34.440
- Middle.
- I wanna just give a shout

00:01:34.440 --> 00:01:36.503
to "Troll 2", because I
love the goblins in that.

00:01:36.503 --> 00:01:38.206
- Okay, fine! Go "Troll 2!"
- All right, "Trolls 2!"

00:01:38.206 --> 00:01:39.039
- They're not even trolls
(buzzer sounds)

00:01:39.039 --> 00:01:40.022
- Who was it?

00:01:40.022 --> 00:01:41.130
- Middle. I should-
(bell dings)

00:01:41.130 --> 00:01:43.051
- Oh my God.
- Take me to Vegas!

00:01:43.051 --> 00:01:44.101
- This is unbelievable.

00:01:44.101 --> 00:01:44.934
- Thank you guys so much.

00:01:44.934 --> 00:01:45.767
- Thanks, Dolores, appreciate it.

00:01:45.767 --> 00:01:46.670
That was very cool.

00:01:46.670 --> 00:01:48.668
- Thank you so much.
- That was fun.

00:01:48.668 --> 00:01:49.501
- Thank you.
- Super fun.

00:01:49.501 --> 00:01:51.385
- Very fun.
(woman screams)

